{"a":[40,41],"h":"<p>40.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"123\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 122.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 32.3 39.0 39.0 47.3 63.0 63.0 69.7 78.0 78.0 90.0 90.0 98.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"32.3 47.3 98.3 106.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Nice yüzler de o gün<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"70\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 70.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 31.6 31.6 38.3 45.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 38.3 45.0 54.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> üzerlerinde <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"63\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 62.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 23.3 30.7 37.6\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 30.7 37.6 46.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bir gubar - tortoz istîlâ etmiş 41.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"78\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 77.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 31.6 31.6 38.3 47.3 47.3 54.8\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 38.3 54.8 61.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o tozu da<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"61\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 60.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.3 30.7 37.4\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 30.7 37.4 44.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> is gibi bir karanlık sarmıştır. Yüzlerde böyle tortozla karanın ictimaı ise havf ü zillet ile elem ve azâbın en mûhiş tezahürüdür. </p>"}